#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:3
#: 9a51caf9aedb4968a75fc023eebcc5bc
msgid "随机占位（Random Occupancy）"
msgstr "Random Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 6d8cc8807766401ab42b0133ef610a8c
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `RandomOccupancyCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:7
#: 346a76a8b1c34d5696f5b27c5e77acaa
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 86536067d1504739854590e103c1e39a
msgid ""
"在给定总成分约束下，将目标配比真正落到原子占位上。读取 `Comp(...)` "
"标签或手工输入的成分字符串，用精确或随机模式把各元素分配到离散晶格位点，输出带 `Occ(...)` 标签的真实化学占位结构。"
msgstr ""
"Realize a target composition as discrete atomic occupations. The card reads "
"a `Comp(...)` label or a manual composition, assigns species to lattice "
"sites in Exact or Random mode, and outputs actual chemical configurations "
"labeled `Occ(...)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:11
#: ca6b45edd3bd4ffe824db79d9da08fee
msgid "典型用法：接在 `Composition Sweep` 之后，把目标配比计划转化为可以跑 DFT/NEP 的实际结构。"
msgstr ""
"The standard use is after `Composition Sweep`, converting composition plans "
"into structures that can be relaxed and labeled by DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:13
#: be3f8be4bb8a41fd8e144e9fd4c970d7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 51e124f7574344eca4573d5f444c8eae
msgid "场景：同成分不同排布下的能量预测，模型偏差从 5 跳到 50 meV/atom"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: Error jumps from 5 to 50 meV/atom between arrangements at one "
"composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:17
#: aae0853860384f158f5ea480f85a9d2a
msgid ""
"你在 CoCrNi 训练集上跑了 `Composition Sweep`，覆盖了从纯元素到等摩尔的各种配比。但每个配比只生成了一个占位结构——对 "
"Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33，训练集里 Cr 永远在角落、Co 永远在面心。模型学到的不是\"这个成分\"，而是\"这个成分 + "
"这个特定排布\"。拿到另一个同样成分但 Cr/Co 位置互换的结构，能量预测偏差从 5 meV/atom 跳到了 50 meV/atom。"
msgstr ""
"A CoCrNi composition sweep covers pure-to-equiatomic fractions, but each "
"composition has one occupation. At Co0.33Cr0.33Ni0.33, Cr always occupies "
"one site family and Co another. The model binds composition to that "
"arrangement and fails when Co and Cr exchange sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:19
#: 10a8abb54dae417b83e807120aad3f14
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"对给定成分，短程化学有序度——哪种原子偏好和哪种原子做邻居——显著影响总能量和局域力。训练集里每种成分只有一个排布样本，模型就把成分和特定排布绑死了。解决：给每个目标配比生成多个不同占位版本。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Short-range chemical order at fixed composition strongly "
"affects energy and forces. Generate several occupation variants for each "
"target fraction so the model does not conflate composition with one "
"arrangement."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:21
#: 4435c4d7205a4e619239cef3eb0232ad
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一批带 `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` 标签的结构（来自上游 `Composition "
"Sweep`）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** Structures labeled `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` by "
"`Composition Sweep`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:23
#: 6bc2770a0f8f440786bbf163f8ac4075
msgid "**目标：** 每个目标配比生成 5 个不同原子排布版本，覆盖排布多样性"
msgstr "**Objective:** Generate five distinct occupations per target composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:25
#: 987297f6a1cf43f2bb10562082b319db
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:26
#: d42035928c4f4a609f7e039777102e5c
msgid "`source` = `Auto (Comp tag)` （自动读取上游 Comp 标签）"
msgstr "`source` = `Auto (Comp tag)`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:27
#: f2f1e6b830c34393836c03660efb1d27
msgid "`mode` = `Exact` （精确匹配目标配比，每次排布不同但元素计数一致）"
msgstr "`mode` = `Exact` to keep counts fixed while changing arrangements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:28
#: f38f15ebb684414f9c4ab0f3cb2ef0a3
msgid "`samples` = `5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:30
#: bef667e758484ee8aba5d2c958bcc9ea
msgid "**输出：** 每个输入结构产生 5 个带 `Occ(E)` 标签的结构，元素组成与 Comp 标签一致但原子排布各不相同"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Five `Occ(E)` structures per input, with species counts matching"
" `Comp` and distinct arrangements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:32
#: d7a7d93b94c54315b479e70e5ad14669
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:33
#: 750a4c9e51ba4bed85222b155cd9614b
msgid "重训后对同一成分的不同排布跑推理，能量方差应该合理——不应全坍缩到一个值，也不应异常发散"
msgstr ""
"After labeling and retraining, predictions across arrangements at one "
"composition should reflect physical differences without anomalous "
"divergence."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:34
#: 7ac08b541a9745a88096ff704e382fb1
msgid "抽查几个占位输出，确认元素计数与目标配比一致（Exact 模式）或统计上接近（Random 模式）"
msgstr ""
"Check several outputs: Exact counts should match the target integer "
"allocation, while Random counts should approach it statistically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:35
#: 7fad001646374c828490047d0fe99453
msgid "如果不同排布之间的能量差异非常小且体系对排布不敏感，可以减少 `samples`；差异大则增大"
msgstr ""
"Reduce `samples` when validated arrangement energies are nearly insensitive;"
" increase it when short-range order matters strongly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:36
#: 2d92cb051fd449f1995c718ca81993f6
msgid "如果上游没有 `Comp(...)` 标签导致输出=输入，切换到手工模式并填写 `manual` 成分字符串"
msgstr ""
"If no upstream `Comp(...)` label exists, switch to Manual and provide the "
"composition explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:38
#: 96d6d212064549b28987ba3bb0b248b4
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:40
#: 4f3eff0f7e584cf09923d9f810426857
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:41
#: 88e839a97366451b96981721d055d531
msgid "上游有 `Composition Sweep` 或手工定义了目标配比，需要落到具体原子占位"
msgstr ""
"A target composition from `Composition Sweep` or manual input must be "
"realized as sites"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:42
#: de2b937052374209a48de30ba227a86a
msgid "同一成分下需要多个不同原子排布来覆盖短程化学有序度"
msgstr ""
"Several arrangements at one composition are needed to cover short-range "
"chemical order"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:43
#: 5b8db9e7de264ddb82841acc29fda7d0
msgid "高熵合金、固溶体等需要成分-排布联合采样的体系"
msgstr ""
"A high-entropy alloy or solid solution requires joint composition-"
"arrangement sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:45
#: b66faf7653d44f008c61f84b298e78d5
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:46
#: 56a6a8c93e9046cdac54db334ef1c9c9
msgid "不需要改变原子占位"
msgstr "Atomic occupations should not change"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:47
#: 40e5f7969b574511b1b6ff4ac9ca092b
msgid "需要直接指定替换规则而非从配比出发 → 用 `Random Doping`"
msgstr "A direct substitution rule is known; use `Random Doping`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:48
#: 843887d403bf4c8ea1486bda8a075f64
msgid "输入本身已经是真实的离散占位结构且不再需要多样性"
msgstr ""
"The input already has realized occupations and no additional arrangement "
"diversity is needed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:50
#: 2a2d5eee29c7414fbe27e15feeddcae6
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:52
#: 959063a489a44227a20766586465966c
msgid "Source（source）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:54
#: d355ba0855e345559e3012d24a8db991
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Auto (Comp tag)`。`Auto` 从输入结构的 `Config_type` 中读取 `Comp(...)` "
"标签作为目标配比，适合接在 `Composition Sweep` 之后。`Manual` 从下面的 `manual` 字段读取手工配比字符串。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Auto (Comp tag)`. `Auto` reads a `Comp(...)` target from "
"`Config_type`, normally after `Composition Sweep`. `Manual` reads the "
"`manual` field."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:56
#: 609384a3b41a40e48b164a2f789d69e4
msgid "Manual（manual）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:58
#: 22490d7740b3426e84a1bb563547663d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。成分字符串，如 `Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`，仅在 `source=Manual` "
"时生效。比例会被自动归一化。只输入单个元素如 `Ge` 时按 `Ge:1.0` 处理；输入 `Ge,C` 则两个元素默认权重都是 1.0。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default; Manual only. Composition such as "
"`Co:0.333,Cr:0.333,Ni:0.334`; fractions are normalized. `Ge` means `Ge:1.0`,"
" while `Ge,C` gives both unit weight."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:60
#: 63dde2297d1d45e1887ea1be7c31b73b
msgid "Mode（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:62
#: 06aaae94c104464290ecbf7d997e5c75
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Exact`。`Exact` "
"精确匹配目标配比，每个原子的元素分配满足目标计数（向下取整后按余数补足），适合对比实验。`Random` "
"按目标比例概率采样，整体统计接近但不严格匹配，适合探索性跑样。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Exact`. `Exact` converts fractions to integer counts by "
"floor-and-remainder allocation, giving fixed composition for comparisons. "
"`Random` samples species probabilities and matches only statistically, which"
" suits exploration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:64
#: 156cb444cd5b407ebaa69bec5c29da39
msgid "Samples（samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:66
#: df7a1b85295d44008eaaed39201ea851
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构为每个目标配比生成多少个不同占位版本。典型值 1-20。注意总输出 = 上游配比点数 x 这个值，先估算规模再跑。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Occupation variants per input target, commonly 1-20. "
"Total output equals upstream target count times this value; estimate before "
"running."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:68
#: cfe5906c48f948fba1f957f0f42b09f5
msgid "Group Filter（group_filter）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:70
#: 8ad9b8e6ccf543de868da52fb09893f8
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。逗号分隔的 group 标签，如 `A,B`。限制只在这些 group 内的位点上做占位分配。需要输入结构已带 "
"`atoms.arrays['group']`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Comma-separated group labels such as `A,B`; only "
"those sites are reassigned. Input must contain `atoms.arrays['group']`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:72
#: b229c4b8a5114ecabb73c78cd0025cc9
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:74
#: 1dd885a9d1b1412d895f7005c816f0e3
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机路径，`seed` 不同取值产生不同占位分布。程序会结合输入结构的 stable config ID "
"为每个样本派生独立种子。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Fix the random path. The card combines `seed` with "
"the stable configuration ID to derive per-sample seeds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:76
#: 51268ff37b1a4d348cab9ecfe3aa500f
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:78
#: 7cacb7d1c6b44ed48c2eb2921c5e8210
msgid "`int`，默认 0。不同取值产生不同的占位分布。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Different values generate different occupation "
"distributions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:80
#: 312ae6797b66467480dde2da83b33d68
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:82
#: 65b138fba1b74b6fa0721c849def6d2e
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:84
#: f715145c55314fceb03077b00d56d1b8
msgid "单样本落地（每配比 1 排布，快速验证占位路径）"
msgstr "Single realization per composition for a quick path check"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:85
#: 2bb9e18ef3484626a31467248cffd5ad
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"source\": \"Auto (Comp tag)\",\n"
"  \"manual\": \"\",\n"
"  \"mode\": \"Exact\",\n"
"  \"samples\": [1],\n"
"  \"group_filter\": \"\",\n"
"  \"use_seed\": false,\n"
"  \"seed\": [0]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:99
#: 128fb64e0b994933954fea3c83257ac0
msgid "多样性占位（每配比 5 排布，常规训练用）"
msgstr "Diverse occupations (five per composition for routine training)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:100
#: f784ecb329a14a6d8822e051c188e183
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"source\": \"Auto (Comp tag)\",\n"
"  \"manual\": \"\",\n"
"  \"mode\": \"Exact\",\n"
"  \"samples\": [5],\n"
"  \"group_filter\": \"\",\n"
"  \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"  \"seed\": [42]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:114
#: 508bd7ecf88a4efebff0500d9d564971
msgid "高多样性子晶格（每配比 20 排布，仅限 group A）"
msgstr "High-diversity sublattice sampling (20 per composition, group A only)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:115
#: 9907d03775bf414fb1480f72236ccdcd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomOccupancyCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"source\": \"Auto (Comp tag)\",\n"
"  \"manual\": \"\",\n"
"  \"mode\": \"Random\",\n"
"  \"samples\": [20],\n"
"  \"group_filter\": \"A\",\n"
"  \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"  \"seed\": [42]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:129
#: bff5ba4e7e7c4b45ab61e30ed815ea1d
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:131
#: e676401b3a5d41b486989faea0c2920a
msgid "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy`：标准合金 pipeline，配比 → 落位。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy`: standard alloy path from "
"fractions to sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:132
#: 19a52d753bee493b81c2291a58520d03
msgid "`Group Label` → `Random Occupancy`：先打 group 标签，再限制占位区域。"
msgstr ""
"`Group Label` -> `Random Occupancy`: label a sublattice before restricting "
"occupation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:133
#: 2a21e3de603e4ad8bcc30d493e1eb46f
msgid "`Random Occupancy` → `Atomic Perturb`：占位后加坐标噪声松驰局部应力。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate diversity after "
"occupation; use relaxation for physical structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:135
#: 0bdf5480edb2475e89849b582160d7cc
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:137
#: 191b19f22b1e4a01a865585513ef2139
msgid ""
"**输出 = 输入，没有变化。** 上游没有 `Comp(...)` 标签且 `manual` 为空。检查 `source` 设置，或切换到 "
"Manual 模式并填写成分。"
msgstr ""
"**Output equals input.** No `Comp(...)` label was found and `manual` is "
"empty. Correct `source` or enter a manual composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:139
#: e6fa72b8231a4533965a68f3ce20f2ab
msgid "**占位后元素数量与标签不一致。** `Random` 模式下统计浮动是正常的。换 `Exact` 模式可精确匹配。"
msgstr ""
"**Species counts differ from the target.** Random mode fluctuates "
"statistically; use Exact for deterministic integer counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:141
#: dfa0e6e5093947bb84c413ac931200d4
msgid ""
"**输出数量远超预期。** 输出 = 输入帧数 x `samples`。上游 500 个配比点 x `samples=5` = 2500 "
"个结构。先估算总规模再跑。"
msgstr ""
"**Output is much larger than expected.** Count is input frames times "
"`samples`; 500 targets with five samples produce 2,500 structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:143
#: 44c5f1fce58a44e6aaf26ea43234cee7
msgid "**group_filter 不生效。** 检查输入结构是否有 `atoms.arrays['group']` 且标签拼写完全匹配。"
msgstr ""
"**`group_filter` has no effect.** Confirm `atoms.arrays['group']` exists and"
" labels match exactly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:145
#: cf4cb44178ea4f5eaf1199a04366d47d
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-occupancy-card.md:147
#: cef8937084004528b37312ab6e51a132
msgid ""
"`Occ(E)` / `Occ(R)` / `Occ(E,s=...)` / `Occ(R,s=...)`。E = Exact，R = "
"Random。使用 seed 时附加种子值便于追踪。"
msgstr ""
"`Occ(E)`, `Occ(R)`, `Occ(E,s=...)`, or `Occ(R,s=...)`; E means Exact and R "
"Random. Seeded output includes the seed for traceability."

